{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27120","headline":"晚题江馆 · 周贺","name":"晚题江馆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病寄曲江居带城，傍门孤柳一蝉鸣。\n澄波月上见鱼掷，晚径叶多闻犬行。\n越岛夜无侵阁色，寺钟凉有隔原声。\n故园尽卖休官去，潮水秋来空自平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27120.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27120","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}